WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.162
The Men Who Controlled the Investigations.

00:00:03.112 --> 00:00:11.175
Brigadier-General Simon Trudeau, Provost Marshal from 2018 to 2024, commands all military police.

00:00:11.175 --> 00:00:15.600
The MPCC accused him of obstructing independent reviews.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:22.387
Lieutenant-Colonel Eric LeBlanc, CFNIS Commander, cleared General Vance in 2015.

00:00:22.387 --> 00:00:26.937
Six years later Vance pleaded guilty to obstruction of justice.

00:00:26.937 --> 00:00:29.350
The chain protects itself.
